Extraction: STARTCHAR blocks with 8x16 (narrow) or 16x16 (wide) BBX were packed
MSB-first into fonts/unifont16.bin (see glyphs.py for the format). The cache
contains unaltered glyph bitmaps; the exception above covers this embedding.
